### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "nickname": "홍길동"
}

### 로그인 → 토큰 복사
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 게시글 작성 (토큰 필요)
POST http://localhost:8080/trade-posts
Authorization: Bearer {토큰붙여넣기}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "아이폰 15 팔아요",
  "description": "3개월 사용, 케이스 포함",
  "price": 900000,
  "category": "ELECTRONICS",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/img.jpg"
}

### 목록 조회 (비로그인 가능)
GET http://localhost:8080/trade-posts?page=0&size=10

### 카테고리 필터 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/trade-posts?category=ELECTRONICS&page=0&size=10

### 키워드 검색
GET http://localhost:8080/trade-posts?keyword=아이폰&page=0&size=10

### 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/trade-posts/1

### 상태 변경 (예약중으로)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/trade-posts/1/status?status=RESERVED
Authorization: Bearer {토큰}

### 찜 토글
POST http://localhost:8080/trade-posts/1/wish
Authorization: Bearer {토큰}

### 내 게시글 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/trade-posts/my-posts
Authorization: Bearer {토큰}

### 내 찜 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/trade-posts/my-wishes
Authorization: Bearer {토큰}

### 게시글 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/trade-posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {토큰}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "아이폰 15 (수정)",
  "description": "가격 낮췄어요",
  "price": 850000,
  "category": "ELECTRONICS",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/img.jpg"
}

### 게시글 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/trade-posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {토큰}